      "source_seconds": 1376.24,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "“双赢”两个字，不能代替对合作的检查",
      "source_seconds": 1247.81,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "一场失败让他重新理解“我们这一边”",
      "source_seconds": 2067.339,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "威胁听起来很大，仍要分辨它究竟说了什么",
      "source_seconds": 2487.7,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "紧迫感越强，越需要确认自己在和谁说话",
      "source_seconds": 3097.98,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "“怎样做”和“接下来是什么”，把对话带向落实",
      "source_seconds": 3844.12,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "身体的不安可以提醒检查，不能替你宣判真相",
      "source_seconds": 4172.509,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "看见了变化，还要问变化意味着什么",
      "source_seconds": 4608.7,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "一条信息先完成一件事",
      "source_seconds": 4847.94,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "坏消息可以提前说明，但不必拖成长篇铺垫",
      "source_seconds": 5338.429,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "疲惫时得到的同意，明天还要经得起实施",
      "source_seconds": 5803.91,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "在小事里练习，让重要时刻不必临时变一个人",
      "source_seconds": 5963.88,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "有人来倾诉时，先说出你听到的困难",
      "source_seconds": 6396.98,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "能够交接和休息，也是长期工作的能力",
      "source_seconds": 7056.0,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "极端案例里，他努力让一个人重新成为具体的人",
